egistered_grammars_match_their_profiles_and_parse_the_selected_language]` checks the registered grammars.\n- **Trait shape.** `crates/trust-but-verify/tests/public_api.rs#fn[public_exports_match_the_appendix]` checks the public API inventory. The trait signature is a structural obligation, so it needs no behavioral test.\n\nI found no gap."
